{"title":"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>Gabe creates a sequence using toothpicks. In the sequence, Figure 1 is formed using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> toothpicks. Each figure after Figure 1 has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more toothpicks than the previous figure. The first three figures are shown.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>How many toothpicks does Gabe need in total to make the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> figures?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2f64b75dacccc51937e870dda78ab2ba8e899f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{N} = \\frac{N}{2}(2a_{1} + (N - 1)d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"204\" height=\"39\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3e52ca31b70a3d2ffa068f45577eda344d543b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"17\" /> is the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> of the sequence of the number of toothpicks, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4f8473eac20565df46e727e7b9f14fca92a9ec9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> represents the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> term of the sequence, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the common difference of the sequence. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c52ba0ffaa830ac0c5667e96f4e8906aca426825.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{N} = \\frac{N}{2}(2 \\times 4 + 3(N - 1)) = \\frac{N}{2}(8 + 3N - 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"366\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/d/91debf014c2b8c716b8ba1210c0be40911b2f068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{N}{2}(3N + 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 1\">player 1</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/9/c996acd51c78d9ece0ff3d8e78057e9a77fbbb6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/69875ec98826eac8d8fc10b2f0414a727ad7f264.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{N} = S_{5} = \\frac{5}{2}(3 \\times 5 + 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"192\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/4/a54e5e803bfa8848d76c2ae8db5479c3602129aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{5}{2} \\times 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/3/21366d41d8db706f9f3fa3cbbae681b74799442e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{N} = \\boxed{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"79\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC\">2023 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<